Bootstrap Icons in RT
=====================

Unlike most entries under devel/third-party/, this directory does not hold a
local copy of the upstream source. RT ships a curated subset of the Bootstrap
Icons SVG files directly under share/static/images/.

The list of icons RT actually uses lives in the %SVG configuration variable
in etc/RT_Config.pm.in. That hash is the canonical reference for which icons
need to be present.

To update to a new release of Bootstrap Icons:

1. Download the release archive from
   https://github.com/twbs/icons/releases (or `npm install bootstrap-icons`).

2. For each icon name listed in %SVG, copy the matching SVG file from the
   release's `icons/` directory into share/static/images/.

3. Update the `version:` field in metadata.yml and regenerate the top-level
   devel/third-party/README.
